  "content": "<div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Here you’ll find links to profiles of key people involved in The Beatles’ story, from the members of the band through to their wives and girlfriends, friends, colleagues and collaborators. <span id=\"more-351\"></span></p><p>It isn’t a comprehensive list, and nor could it ever be – far too many people made an impact upon the group’s history. However, we hope to add more profiles in the near future.</p><div class=\"discography-grid\"><div class=\"discography-card\"><a href=\"/people/alexis-mardas/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"47987\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/people/alexis-mardas-200x200/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alexis-mardas-200x200.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"200,200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Alexis Mardas (Magic Alex)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alexis-mardas-200x200.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/alexis-mardas-200x200.jpg\" alt=\"Alexis Mardas (Magic Alex)\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-47987\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alexis-mardas-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alexis-mardas-200x200-66x66.jpg 66w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a><p></p><h2><a href=\"/people/alexis-mardas/\">Alexis Mardas (Magic Alex)</a></h2></div><div class=\"discography-card\"><a href=\"/people/alistair-taylor/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"47989\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/people/alistair-taylor-200x200/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alistair-taylor-200x200.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"200,200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Alistair Taylor\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alistair-taylor-200x200.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/alistair-taylor-200x200.jpg\" alt=\"Alistair Taylor\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-47989\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alistair-taylor-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alistair-taylor-200x200-66x66.jpg 66w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"></a><p></p><h2><a href=\"/people/alistair-taylor/\">Alistair Taylor</a></h2></div><div class=\"discography-card\"><a href=\"/people/allan-williams/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"47990\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/people/allan-williams-200x200/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/allan-williams-200x200.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"200,200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Allan Williams\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/allan-williams-200x200.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/allan-williams-200x200.jpg\" alt=\"Allan Williams\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-47990\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/allan-williams-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/allan-williams-200x200-66x66.jpg 66w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"></a><p></p><h2><a href=\"/people/allan-williams/\">Allan Williams</a></h2></div><div class=\"discography-card\"><a href=\"/people/allen-klein/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image